<title>USA: Milestone Properties not to pay prfd div.</title>
<headline>Milestone Properties not to pay prfd div.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Real estate company Milestone Properties Inc said Thursday its board of directors had decided not to pay a dividend on its $0.78 convertible series A preferred stock.</p>
<p>Milestone said said holders of the stock were no longer entitled to receive dividends on a cumulative basis since September 30.</p>
<p>The stock's par value is $0.01 per share for the quarter ending March 31, it said.</p>
</text>
